  "subject": "Addendum to 2026-05-23-0900 hand-off — PO sharpening: -defs are data formats; OAGP is an organizational pattern; oagp-org needs to exist; most of what was handed off is OAGP-pattern-shape (re-route to oagp-strategist when staffed) not orgdef-format-shape (you retain)",

